    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im kinda worried about my partner. they have type 1 diabetes and they've been feeling really sick lately. they keep saying they are super thirsty and nauseous and they seem a bit out of it/confused. my husband also said their breath smells kind of sweet like fruit or nail polish?? i think maybe they just need to drink a bunch of water and sleep it off? what do u think?",
