      "content": "idk i dont want to go to the er right now if i can help it... its super late and it's gonna be so expensive. they already checked their glucose and it was actually kinda high but not like crazy high. maybe if i just give them some extra insulin and lots of water they will feel better in the morning? do u think we can just monitor them at home for a few hours?",
